# Stack (no sugerir alternativas sin pedirlo)

Next.js 14 App Router · TypeScript strict · Supabase (DB, Auth, Storage) · @supabase/ssr · Tailwind v3 · shadcn/ui · @dnd-kit/core · qrcode · Resend · Vercel · **pnpm** (nunca npm) · React state + Server Actions (sin Redux/Zustand)

## Carpetas (`src/`)

```
src/app/(auth)/login|register
src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/{restaurante,carta,analytics,cuenta}
src/app/carta/[slug]          # pública, SSR, sin auth
src/app/api/
src/components/{ui,dashboard,carta-publica,shared}
src/lib/{supabase/{client,server,middleware}.ts,utils.ts,types.ts}
src/hooks/
middleware.ts                 # protege /dashboard/*
```

- `ui/`: shadcn — no editar archivos base; extender con `className`
- Tipos de dominio en `src/lib/types.ts`
